            <ArticleTitle>Visualization of stents in the left anterior descending coronary artery by transthoracic echocardiography in pigs and humans.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>229-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this study, we demonstrate that coronary artery stents can be visualized by transthoracic 2-dimensional echocardiography. We were able to image stents in the left anterior descending coronary artery in 6 of 6 pigs and in 6 of 7 patients studied.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
